### Variabel — sesuaikan sebelum tes
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api
@apiKey = GANTI_DENGAN_API_KEY_MESIN_ABSENSI
@idMesin = MESIN_ABSENSI_01

### Tap absensi — berhasil (finger_id harus ada di DB)
POST {{baseUrl}}/mesin/tap
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}

{
  "id_mesin": "{{idMesin}}",
  "finger_id": 1
}

### Tap absensi — tanpa API key (harus 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/mesin/tap
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_mesin": "{{idMesin}}",
  "finger_id": 1
}
